            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A calm, private space to track every moment — from first flutter to final countdown."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un spațiu calm și privat pentru fiecare moment — de la primul flutter la numărătoarea inversă."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A calm, private space to track every moment — from first flutter to final countdown."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ett lugnt, privat utrymme för varje ögonblick — från första fladder till sista nedräkningen."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "พื้นที่สงบและเป็นส่วนตัวสำหรับทุกช่วงเวลา — ตั้งแต่การดิ้นครั้งแรกจนถึงนับถอยหลัง"
          }
